<div class="problem-wrapper" id="problem">
  <section class="section-wrap problem">
    <h2 class="section-title">The Problem</h2>

    <p class="lead">
      <strong>Google Takeout exports are a mess.</strong> JSON sidecar files get their
      names truncated at random lengths. Windows MAX_PATH silently breaks <code
        >glob()</code
      >. Duplicate photo copies share a single metadata file. Timestamps end up
      as today's date. Most tools fail silently on these edge cases — or refuse
      to start at all.
    </p>

    <div class="problem-real-test-results">
      <div class="test">
        <span class="test-emoji">📁 Files</span>
        <span class="test-number">12,089</span>
        <span class="test-text">Files in the test export</span>
      </div>

      <div class="test">
        <span class="test-emoji">✅ Success Rate</span>
        <span class="test-number">99.99%</span>
        <span class="test-text">successfully dated & organized</span>
      </div>

      <div class="test">
        <span class="test-emoji">🧩 Methods</span>
        <span class="test-number">6</span>
        <span class="test-text">JSON matching strategies</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
